        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion F6, Contemporary Two Piece Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary handleset made by Fusion is cast from solid brass. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this two piece handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. It is available in either polished chrome or brushed nickel finish; and it fits all standard bore hole door preparations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<v>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Solid Brass Fusion F6 Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass forging and casting.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist that eliminates \"knob wobble\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion F6 Modern Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Center Door Boring: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Height: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Height 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and a turn knob on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
