                "description": "Contemporary Two Piece Handleset Fusion F6 - This contemporary handleset made by Fusion is cast from solid brass. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this two piece handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. It is available in either polished chrome or brushed nickel finish; and it fits all standard bore hole door preparations.",
